# Desktop-environment metadata. These carry machine-local settings — a
# `.directory` names an icon path on one person's computer — and the release
# process records every tracked file as source, so one that is tracked is
# hashed into the candidate's source id and shipped in its source archive.
.directory
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The scratch directory an archived copy of an unrelated tool was dropped into.
# FINAL-05 found `archive-EWXwoU/gk_3.1.75_linux_amd64.zip` tracked here and
# shipped inside the candidate's source archive. Anchored to the repository
# root, so a directory named `archive-*` anywhere else is unaffected, and
# nothing is judged by its extension.
/archive-*/
